sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户 (前端)
    participant API as Axum API
    participant Auth as Auth 中间件
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant AI as AI 服务
    participant OCR as Ollama / PaddleOCR

    Note over U,OCR: 合同创建 + AI 自动审查

    U->>API: POST /api/contracts {contract_name, content, counterparty_type}
    API->>Auth: require_auth (验证 session_token)
    Auth-->>API: AuthUser {user_id, company_id}
    API->>DB: INSERT INTO contracts VALUES (...)
    DB-->>API: contract_id

    API-->>U: 200 OK {id: contract_id}

    Note over API,AI: 异步后台审查 (不阻塞用户)

    API->>DB: UPDATE contracts SET ai_review_status = 'reviewing'
    API->>AI: POST /v1/chat/completions {合同内容 + 审查 prompt}
    AI-->>API: {review: "...", risk_level: "🔴 high"}
    API->>DB: UPDATE contracts SET ai_risk_level, ai_review_result, ai_reviewed_at

    Note over U,OCR: OCR 文档识别

    U->>API: POST /api/ai/parse-document {file_base64, document_type}
    API->>OCR: POST /api/generate {model: paddleocr-vl:1.5, images: [...]}
    OCR-->>API: 结构化字段 JSON
    API-->>U: {fields: {title, amount, date, ...}}

    Note over U,OCR: 政策智能匹配

    U->>API: GET /api/v1/policies/match
    API->>DB: SELECT company profile (country, revenue, employees, founder)
    API->>DB: SELECT all policies
    API-->>API: 计算匹配分数 (country +40, education +15, returnee +15)
    API-->>U: [{policy, match_score, reasons}]
